  "created": "2026-06-09T06:40:46.863Z",
  "description": "On-device LLM inference for Circle. 1.4.1 finishes the KV-cache compression path: KvCompressionMode (Off / TurboQuant4Bit / TurboQuant3Bit / TurboQuant2Bit) now routes through MNN's native TQ3/TQ4 attention quantization via the ATTENTION_OPTION runtime hint (CPUAttention.cpp). Modes are applied at load() time via Llm::set_config; mnnbridge bumped to 1.2.0 (was 1.1.0). Also adds C++ TurboQuant codec port (turboquant.cpp) for native embedding compression and parity testing — round-trip matches managed CircleAI.Core.Compression.TurboQuantCodec within 1e-2. New mnn_turboquant_round_trip C ABI export proves parity. All 8 RIDs rebuilt with the new code: win-x64, linux-x64, linux-arm64, osx-arm64, osx-x64, android-arm64, android-arm, ios-arm64.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
